nd in Moses [was a sign], when We sent him to Pharaoh with clear authority.","j":27,"h":53,"s":51,"a":38,"sd":null},{"k":"51:39","t":"But he turned away with his supporters and said, \"A magician or a madman.\"","j":27,"h":53,"s":51,"a":39,"sd":null},{"k":"51:40","t":"So We took him and his soldiers and cast them into the sea, and he was blameworthy.","j":27,"h":53,"s":51,"a":40,"sd":null},{"k":"51:41","t":"And in ʿAad [was a sign], when We sent against them the barren wind.","j":27,"h":53,"s":51,"a":41,"sd":null},{"k":"51:42","t":"It left nothing of what it came upon but that it made it like disintegrated ruins.","j":27,"h":53,"s":51,"a":42,"sd":null},{"k":"51:43","t":"And in Thamūd, when it was said to them, \"Enjoy yourselves for a time.\"","j":27,"h":53,"s":51,"a":43,"sd":null},{"k":"51:44","t":"But they were insolent toward the command of their Lord, so the thunderbolt seized them while they were looking on.","j":27,"h":53,"s":51,"a":44,"sd":null},{"k":"51:45","t":"And they were unable to arise, nor could they defend themselves.","j":27,"h":53,"s":51,"a":45,"sd":null},{"k":"51:46","t":"And [We destroyed] the people of Noah before; indeed, they were a people defiantly disobedient.","j":27,"h":53,"s":51,"a":46,"sd":null},{"k":"51:47","t":"And the heaven We constructed with strength, and indeed, We are [its] expander.","j":27,"h":53,"s":51,"a":47,"sd":null},{"k":"51:48","t":"And the earth We have spread out, and excellent is the preparer.","j":27,"h":53,"s":51,"a":48,"sd":null},{"k":"51:49","t":"And of all things We created two mates [i.e., counterparts]; perhaps you will remember.","j":27,"h":53,"s":51,"a":49,"sd":null},{"k":"51:50","t":"So flee to Allāh. Indeed, I am to you from Him a clear warner.","j":27,"h":53,"s":51,"a":50,"sd":null},{"k":"51:51","t":"And do not make [as equal] with Allāh another deity. Indeed, I am to you from Him a clear warner.","j":27,"h":53,"s":51,"a":51,"sd":null}],"juz":27,"hizb":53,"surahs":[51],"sajdah":false}